    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17644" root="زرد" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُرْدَةٌ</span></b>  [The <i>quantity that is swallowed at once;</i>
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُرْعَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُلْعَةٌ</span>;] <i>a morsel,</i> or <i>small mouthful:</i>
so in the saying, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَنَّ فُلَانٌ أَنِّى زُرْدَةٌ لَهُ</span> (tropical:)  [<i>Such a
one thought that I was a morsel for him</i>].
(A, TA.)

